:: ccm-non-vintage-lettering {"position": "2450,250", "size": "100,100"}
Is the customization kind of bubbly, or maybe just a little too wrong?

Proper customization should be flat and smooth, with clean stitching. Bubbly, shiny, or off-color lettering can be the sign a sign of a fake jersey, however it could just be poor workmanship or wear and tear, so be sure to check carefully.

